at": 51.515598, "lon": -0.09927}, {"lat": 51.515614, "lon": -0.098897}, {"lat": 51.515618, "lon": -0.098824}, {"lat": 51.515624, "lon": -0.098765}, {"lat": 51.515637, "lon": -0.098691}, {"lat": 51.515656, "lon": -0.09863}, {"lat": 51.515944, "lon": -0.098601}, {"lat": 51.516003, "lon": -0.098598}, {"lat": 51.516115, "lon": -0.098583}, {"lat": 51.516129, "lon": -0.098581}, {"lat": 51.516156, "lon": -0.098577}, {"lat": 51.516294, "lon": -0.098559}, {"lat": 51.516492, "lon": -0.09855}, {"lat": 51.516564, "lon": -0.098549}, {"lat": 51.516663, "lon": -0.098556}, {"lat": 51.516727, "lon": -0.09857}, {"lat": 51.516848, "lon": -0.098593}, {"lat": 51.516888, "lon": -0.098597}, {"lat": 51.516958, "lon": -0.098605}, {"lat": 51.516989, "lon": -0.098612}, {"lat": 51.51703, "lon": -0.098616}, {"lat": 51.51709, "lon": -0.098623}, {"lat": 51.517133, "lon": -0.098632}, {"lat": 51.517175, "lon": -0.098634}, {"lat": 51.517207, "lon": -0.09863}, {"lat": 51.517236, "lon": -0.098612}, {"lat": 51.517283, "lon": -0.09856}, {"lat": 51.517329, "lon": -0.098489}, {"lat": 51.517353, "lon": -0.098526}, {"lat": 51.517615, "lon": -0.098899}, {"lat": 51.517693, "lon": -0.099003}, {"lat": 51.51774, "lon": -0.099072}, {"lat": 51.51768, "lon": -0.099163}], "directionsSummary": "Approx. 5.7 km by road (16 min drive) from site to hospital A&E."}}, {"text": "9.0 Fire and Emergency Procedures", "type": "heading", "level": 2}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["In the event of fire, the Site Supervisor or his delegated representative must raise the alarm and evacuate the work place.", "Fire extinguishers will be kept on site at all times and will be used if possible. Otherwise, the emergency services will be called.", "The location of the fire assembly point will be confirmed during site inductions."]}, {"type": "image", "caption": "Know your fire extinguisher code", "nasPath": "RAMS Builder/Catalog/fire-extinguisher-code.png", "bundleAssetPath": "/rams/fire-extinguisher-code.png"}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["In the event of a strike of Statutory Undertakers equipment, the relevant Statutory Undertaker must be contacted. The emergency contact numbers for Statutory Undertakers are shown below:", "Electricity (UKPN) – 0800 3163105", "Gas (British Gas) – 0800 111999", "Water (Thames Water) – 0800 714614", "BT – 0800 800154 – Option 8", "Virgin Media – 0800 4080088", "Environmental Agency - 0800 807060", "Health & Safety Executive - 01582 444200", "Emergency Services (999)"]}, {"text": "10.0 Environmental Arrangements", "type": "heading", "level": 2}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["All works will be conducted with due regard to the environmental sensitivity of Hyde Park. Measures will be implemented to minimise noise, dust, and vibration impacts on the surrounding area and park users. A robust waste management plan will be in place to ensure proper segregation, recycling, and disposal of all waste materials in accordance with environmental regulations. Spill prevention and control measures will be maintained for all plant and materials. Protection of existing trees, vegetation, and water bodies will be a priority, with specific controls detailed in site-specific environmental management plans. Dust suppression techniques will be employed during saw cutting and excavation activities. All plant and equipment will be regularly maintained to minimise emissions and leaks."]}, {"text": "10.1 Working around trees", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Where trees are present on or adjacent to the site, works shall comply with BS 5837:2012 and any arboricultural method statement or tree protection plan issued for the project.", "No excavation, storage of materials, plant, spoil or compaction shall take place within the prohibited zone (1 m from the trunk) unless agreed in writing with the Local Authority Tree Officer.", "Within the precautionary zone (4 × tree stem circumference), mechanical excavation shall be avoided where practicable and exposed roots protected.", "Tree protection fencing shall remain in place for the duration of the works."]}, {"type": "image", "caption": "Figure 1 – Working around trees (plan view)", "nasPath": "RAMS Builder/Catalog/tree-protection-diagram.png", "bundleAssetPath": "/rams/tree-protection-diagram.png"}, {"type": "image", "caption": "Figure 2 – Key to diagram", "nasPath": "RAMS Builder/Catalog/tree-protection-key.png", "bundleAssetPath": "/rams/tree-protection-key.png"}, {"text": "11.0 COSHH", "type": "heading", "level": 2}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["The following hazardous materials may be present on site:", "o Diesel oil", "o Petrol", "o Cement based mortar", "o Portland Cement", "o Natural aggregates", "o Silica Dust", "o Marker Spray", "o Epoxy Resin", "All fuels will be stored in a lockable container on storage bunds with 110% capacity.", "COSHH sheets will be kept in the site folder and all operatives will be briefed on these."]}, {"text": "13.0 Method of Work", "type": "heading", "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraphs", "lines": ["CJB Civil Engineering Ltd is committed to executing all works at Hyde Park in a safe, efficient, and environmentally responsible manner. This RAMS outlines the safe systems of work, control measures, and responsibilities for all personnel involved in the project. All operatives will be competent for their assigned tasks, hold relevant certifications, and undergo site-specific inductions. Work will be carried out in strict accordance with this RAMS, relevant health and safety legislation, client requirements, and industry best practices. Appropriate personal protective equipment (PPE) will be worn at all times. Regular toolbox talks and briefings will reinforce safety procedures and address any emerging hazards. Plant and equipment will be subject to daily checks and certified inspections."]}, {"text": "13.1 Prior to Construction", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["All staff to be inducted by client supervisor.", "RAMS to be briefed to all personnel by CJB supervisor.", "Daily site briefings to be carried out.", "Plant checks to be carried out by all plant operatives.", "Barrier off works areas.", "Prior to any excavation taking place the area will be cat scanned and all services marked. Permit to dig to be issued by client supervisor."]}, {"text": "13.2 Delivery and storage of materials", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Materials are only to be delivered during permitted hours.", "Access routes to be agreed with the client supervisor.", "All site vehicles to be parked in the designated area.", "Site to be cleared of all materials at the end of each shift where required."]}, {"text": "13.3 Saw cutting", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Use water suppression kit for all cutting.", "Segregate work area from public.", "Operatives to wear appropriate RPE and hearing protection."]}, {"text": "13.4 Traffic signal works", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Isolate and confirm services de-energised before works.", "Install ducting and chambers per drawings.", "Reinstate surfaces to match existing."]}, {"text": "13.5 Installation of pole cones", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Mark out locations per drawings.", "Drill hole to specified depth and diameter.", "Inject resin and place pole cone and anchor.", "Ensure vertical alignment and support until resin cures."]}, {"text": "13.6 Water barrier installation", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Engineer to mark out locations per drawings.", "Barriers aligned and clipped together using S-clips.", "Fill with water to manufacturer specification."]}, {"text": "13.7 Installation of demarcation studs", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Engineer to mark out locations per drawings.", "Drill holes to specified diameters and depths.", "Clear debris from holes before resin application.", "Inject epoxy resin and set stud flush with surrounding ground."]}, {"text": "13.8 Installation of sign posts and signs", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Locations marked on site per sign schedule.", "Appropriate size holes dug for posts.", "Posts set in post mix and checked for verticality.", "Reinstatement to match existing surface.", "Platform step ladder with handrail for sign installation at height."]}, {"text": "13.9 Site clearance & excavation", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Mark out proposed excavation areas and depths in accordance with drawings.", "Cat scan area and mark up services using standard colour codes.", "Hard material to be broken out using mini digger or hand held breaker as appropriate.", "Excavated material to be removed using grab lorry. No material to be left on site unless agreed.", "As excavation proceeds continue to use cat and genny.", "Exposed services to be protected during works to prevent damage.", "Once formation level is reached area to be inspected by supervisor."]}, {"text": "13.10 Installation of granite kerbs and paving", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Engineer to mark out line and level of kerbs.", "Concrete bed placed in trench and kerbs set to correct level with haunching.", "Kerb lifting clamp with LOLER certification to be used for mechanical lifting.", "Modular paving installed with correct falls on sand/cement mix per drawings.", "Compaction using pedestrian roller and vibrating plate where specified."]}, {"text": "13.11 Rain garden installation", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Excavate to design levels and install membrane layers.", "Place aggregates and soil media per specification.", "Protect finished areas from contamination."]}, {"text": "13.12 Surfacing works", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Prepare formation to required levels.", "Lay base and wearing courses per specification.", "Compact using pedestrian roller and vibrating plate.", "Maintain exclusion zone around hot works."]}, {"text": "13.13 Drainage installation", "type": "heading", "level": 3}, {"type": "bullets", "items": ["Excavate trenches to line and level per drawings.", "Install gullies and pipe runs with correct falls.", "Connections tested and protected prior to backfill."]}, {"type": "image", "caption": "Site layout / vehicle parking (add project-specific plan where required)", "nasPath": "RAMS Builder/Catalog/site-layout-sketch.png", "bundleAssetPath": "/rams/site-layout-sketch.png"}, {"type": "image", "caption": "Kerb lifting clamp (LOLER certified) used for mechanical kerb placement", "nasPath": "RAMS Builder/Catalog/kerb-lifting-clamp.png", "bundleAssetPath": "/rams/kerb-lifting-clamp.png"}, {"text": "14.0 Risk Assessments", "type": "heading", "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraphs", "lines": ["The hazards and associated risks have been identified and given a scored rating using semi-quantitative risk assessment methodology.", "Low Risk: acceptable — proceed with caution and stop the job if anything changes.", "Medium Risk: acceptable if it cannot be reduced further following review by an Authorised Person.", "High Risk: unacceptable — additional controls are needed."]}, {"type": "risk_legend"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Lack of instruction / supervision", "controls": "Site Induction.\\nDaily Briefing.\\nSite File.\\nR.A.M.S.\\nSite induction to be given detailing site hazards & control measures.\\nSite rules to be adhered to.\\nClear working instructions provided.\\nEmployees to only carry out activities as instructed.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 4, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 4, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors\\nInexperienced staff"}, {"hazard": "Moving vehicles, Access and egress of plant, road vehicles and materials to site", "controls": "Work zones to be demarcated from wider site and general public.\\nTraffic management in place.\\nBanksmen for all plant movements and any incoming/outgoing deliveries.\\nPlanned access route in place.\\nFlashing beacons and reverse warning signals on plant / vehicles.", "initialL": 3, "initialS": 5, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 5, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}, {"hazard": "Slips and trips", "controls": "Housekeeping.\\nRun all cables / hoses clear of public access / footways\\nStore material correctly.\\nKeep work area tidy.\\nMaintain good housekeeping. Pedestrian ramps to be used for any kerb crossings.\\nThree points of contact when exiting and entering machinery / vehicles.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 3, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}, {"hazard": "Working adjacent to the public", "controls": "Barriers to segregate works from pedestrians / traffic.\\nAll deliveries will be planned in advance.\\nBanksman to assist loading /unloading and pedestrians directed away from the works.\\nAll plant shall use flashing beacons.\\nLifting Operations will be planned to ensure no lifting takes place over non-site areas.", "initialL": 3, "initialS": 5, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 5, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 001 - General Site Activities"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Vehicle movements during deliveries", "controls": "Banksman for all deliveries.\\nPlanned access route.\\nSegregation from pedestrians.", "initialL": 3, "initialS": 4, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 4, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 002 - Site Setup and Deliveries"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Silica dust and noise", "controls": "Water suppression mandatory.\\nFFP3 and ear defenders.\\nCutting only in permitted hours.", "initialL": 3, "initialS": 4, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 3, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 013 - Saw Cutting"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Contact with live services", "controls": "Isolation confirmed by client.\\nCat scan and permit to dig.\\nSupervisor sign-off.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 5, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 4, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 011 - Traffic Signals"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Manual handling of pole cones", "controls": "Team lift where required.\\nClear access routes.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 2, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 007 - Pole Cones"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Manual handling of empty/filled barriers", "controls": "Mechanical assistance where available.\\nTeam lifts.\\nFill after positioning where possible.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 3, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 008 - Water Barriers"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Use of resin and dust from drilling", "controls": "COSHH sheets available on site.\\nFFP3 when cutting/drilling dust.\\nVentilation where possible.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 3, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 006 - Demarcation Studs"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Working at height installing signs", "controls": "Use platform step ladder with handrail.\\nMaintain three points of contact.\\nSegregate work area.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 3, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 005 - Sign Posts"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Striking buried services", "controls": "Cat and genny scan prior to excavation.\\nPermit to dig.\\nHand dig within 500mm of marked services.\\nSupervisor oversight.", "initialL": 3, "initialS": 5, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 5, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}, {"hazard": "Collapse of excavation", "controls": "Excavations to be battered or shored where required.\\nNo personnel in unsupported excavations deeper than 1.2m without controls.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 4, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 3, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 003 - Excavation"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Manual handling of kerbs and paving units", "controls": "Mechanical lifting where possible.\\nTeam lifts for heavy units.\\nCorrect PPE including gloves.", "initialL": 3, "initialS": 3, "residualL": 2, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 004 - Kerbs and Paving"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Manual handling of aggregates", "controls": "Mechanical placement where possible.\\nWheelbarrows and team lifts.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 3, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 2, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 012 - Rain Gardens"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Hot materials and fumes", "controls": "PPE including gloves and long sleeves.\\nSegregation from public.\\nWater suppression for dust.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 4, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 3, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 010 - Surfacing"}, {"rows": [{"hazard": "Working in excavations", "controls": "Shoring/battering as required.\\nLadder access.\\nSupervisor inspection.", "initialL": 2, "initialS": 4, "residualL": 1, "residualS": 3, "personsAtRisk": "Site personnel\\nMembers of the public\\nVisitors"}], "type": "risk_table", "title": "RA 009 - Drainage"}]}	gemini_attempted	\N	\N	Issued for Approval	[]	\N	\N	51.509376	-0.156512	[]
